\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   How wonderful to be a lamb of Jesus,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To stand in the true shepherd's loving grace!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj No higher place is there in God's creation
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 than, unrestricted, follow in His trace.
\par What all the world can never give
\par that is the part by which the lamb of God will live.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The lamb finds here green pasture for refreshment,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Discovers where the purest wells abound.
\par No human eye can measure all the riches
\par Where precious gifts and blessings may be found.
\par It shall a wondrous life impart
\par That is eternal and that never will depart.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Look how the dead have all the peace in the grave,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj It's like the lamb in the shepherds bosom.
\par His good shepherd has greatly conquered the death
\par Therefore death can not be a threat to him.
\par This flesh shall ever pass away
\par But the spirit shall never ever decompose.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Yet this is but a foretaste of great pleasure,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 What follows is eternal blessedness.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Then shall the shepherd lead to glorious pastures
\par When to the stream of life they  have access.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 All eyes will see then clear and free,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj How beautiful the fold of Jesus  Christ will be.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  The future happiness shall truly be great,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 This earthly joyfulness is very small
\par The Lamb of God shall be the greatest shepherd
\par by the banks of the Holy stream of life
\par and then, it shall truly reveal,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj honour and glory be to Jesus and His Lambs.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

